    <item>
      <title>Version 1.6.90</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Pick which screens the pill uses: tick one or more under Display in Settings, Surfaces.</li>
                    <li>The Today Panel moves: drag it by its top and put it anywhere on your screen.</li>
                    <li>The Today Panel shows other days. One arrow moves a day, two arrows move a week, and Skip passes over empty days.</li>
                    <li>Each day of a project says which day it is, like Day 2 of 6.</li>
                    <li>In the week by the hour, the time now shows in green in the hours down the left.</li>
                </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:46:11 -0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.6.90</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.90</sparkle:shortVersionString>
