    <item>
      <title>Version 1.6.89</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Turn a project all day and each day stays one day, drawn as one bar across the week. Turn it off and the hours come back.</li>
                    <li>Give an event a short description with the i in Event Tasks. Jin Mobile shows it too.</li>
                    <li>Refresh an event from its workflow: new and reworded steps come in, and your ticks stay.</li>
                    <li>Workflow steps can carry a note, and workflows open folded.</li>
                    <li>With Local on, Apple&#x27;s server speech stays off too.</li>
                    <li>The first click into Jin4Mac now reaches the calendar&#x27;s week.</li>
                </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:15:42 -0000</pubDate>
