    <item>
      <title>Version 1.6.82</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Jin4Mac now shares Jin Mobile&#x27;s version number, 1.6.82, so the two apps on the same number carry the same word lists.</li>
                    <li>- Vocabulary phrases fix a slipped word: &quot;generative film&quot; becomes Generative Fill.</li>
                    <li>- 265 business and industry phrases added, the same as on the phone.</li>
                    <li>- Words no longer run together in the Speech Coach (&quot;withespecially&quot;).</li>
                    <li>- My Apps reaches your iPhone and iPad, and edits there come back here.</li>
                    <li>- Click anywhere outside a task you are editing to save it.</li>
                    <li>- Bug fixes.</li>
                </ul>
      ]]></description>
