    <item>
      <title>Version 0.4.56</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Settings, Surfaces: choose whether the pill shows, and set up the Control Surface in one place.</li>
                    <li>A hidden pill fades out at rest and comes back while it listens.</li>
                    <li>Window keys show a fraction and a side, like 1/2 L, and can be switched off.</li>
                    <li>Triggers shows each window trigger with its window picture.</li>
                    <li>Letters spoken with hyphens, like A-B-C, are typed as a spelling.</li>
                </ul>
